      "rationale": "Emotional intensity is a meaningful new axis for what drives strong praise/complaints. However the fine-grained continuous values (e.g. 2.19, 3.15) imply a precision the text cannot really warrant, and the intensely emotional Eamon rant scoring only 2.19 while a calm cream review scores 2.11 undercuts groundedness."
