    }
  ],
  "analytical_usefulness": 0.68,
  "source_groundedness": 0.77,
  "rationale": "The added columns each provide a genuine analytical axis (praise vs complaint language, detail, intensity, aspect coverage) relevant to identifying drivers of praise and complaints, and none are purely constant or trivially redundant. Values are generally sound readings of the source text, with no fabricated facts, though the complaint counts and emotional_intensity show some inconsistency and false precision that modestly lower groundedness. Judged on the two necessary conditions only, the set passes."
